:: Gabe Kitsune Forced Walk [nobr]

/* Intro */
[Note: Collar/Lesh Sprites will be added in Update.]<br>
<br>
You are wandering around your front yard, holding a stick that you use to poke and flip over various things, when you spy something a bit strange dangling from one of the nearby bushes. Approaching closer, you discover something blue and round with a metal circle dangling from it, quickly identifying it as a dog collar. Strange. What is something like that doing here? Did it get caught when a dog ran through the bushes. You reach down to pick it up, <span style="color:BlueViolet">but freeze when you spot the metal name tag dangling from it.</span> <br>

	<<set _ad to [
		{
			Name: "Player",
			State: {
				Mouth: "Frown",
                Blush: 1,
			},
		},
	]>>
	<<ad _ad>>

<span style="Color: LightSteelBlue">“$Player.Name”</span>. <br>
<br>

<div id="choice">
	<<link "Pick up the Collar<br>">>
    <<replace"#choice">>
        You reach down and gingerly pick up the collar, holding it up to ensure it says what you think. <span style="color:BlueViolet">That’s your name, spelt exactly right on the collar. That’s weird enough, but when you look at the back, you feel a shiver run down your spine. The address listed is yours, the phone number <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Your Father</span>’s. What in the world is this-!?</span> <br>
        <br>
        <span style="Color: LightSteelBlue">“Woah, who let you out here?”</span> You are suddenly grabbed from behind and yelp as you are pulled back. <span style="Color: LightSteelBlue">“Hey now, it’s just me. Did <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Noah</span> let you out? He really can’t be doing that.”</span> <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Gabe</span> sighs, petting you on the head. <span style="Color: LightSteelBlue">“Here, let me fix that for you.”</span> <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Gabe</span> <span style="color:LightCoral">takes the collar from your hand and, without giving you a chance to react, snaps it around your neck!</span> <span style="Color: LightSteelBlue">“There we go!”</span> <br>

