            ]>>
            <<ad _ad>>
        /* PC: Collar*/

        You complain and try to tug it off <span style="color:LightCoral">but can’t get your fingers around the latch for some reason!</span> <span style="Color: LightSteelBlue">“Haha, sorry. You need to keep that on in case you get lost. Here, I know what will make you feel better. You’re probably burning up in those clothes, I have no idea why <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Dad</span> thinks it’s a good idea to put you in those dog shirts and stuff.”</span> Dog? You start to ask <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Gabe</span> what on earth he is talking about, <span style="color:LightCoral">when he suddenly yanks you over and begins to strip you right here in the front yard!</span> <br>
        <br>
        <span style="color:LightCoral">You try to fight and resist, but it’s like your dexterity is shot. Your hands become useless, unable to grip anything, and your protests and shouts go ignored as <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Gabe</span> strips you of every last bit of clothing, leaving you utterly naked in your front yard!</span> <br>
        <<storeClothing "Closet" "Naked" 1>>

            <<set _ad to [
                {
                    Name: "Gabe",
                    State: {
                        Outfit: "Everyday",
                        Mouth: "Happy",
                    },
                },
                {
                    Name: "Player",
                    State: {
                        Mouth: "Frown",
                        Blush: 3,
                        Arms: "Hide",
                    },
                },
            ]>>
            <<ad _ad>>
        /* PC: Collar Only */

        <span style="Color: LightSteelBlue">“There we go! Bet you’re feeling nice now!”</span> <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Gabe</span> <span style="color:Pink">smiles as you stand there, covering yourself and shivering in the open air.</span> You try to wrap your brain around what’s happening. <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Gabe</span> isn’t against pulling a prank like this, <span style="color:BlueViolet">but his voice sounds… odd. Not at all malicious, but caring. Like he honestly believes he is helping you!</span> <span style="color:LightCoral">You ask him for your clothes back, but he just chuckles as if he can’t understand a word you are saying. You try to sprint past him back inside, but he grabs you and you hear a metallic CLICK.</span> <br>
        <br>
        <span style="Color: LightSteelBlue">“<span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Dad</span> <span style="color:LightCoral">says we need to walk you twice a day, so let’s do a lap around the neighborhood.”</span> <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Gabe</span> says as you realize a leash has been attached to your collar! You try to undo it, yank it off, but once again find your hands unable to grip anything. It’s almost like…</span> <span style="color:BlueViolet">like your hands are paws… <br>
        <br>
        You look down at your hands. They look like hands to you, but they work as though… You feel the mischievous presence inside you of the spirit and realize what is happening. <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Gabe</span> doesn’t see you as his younger brother, but as a pet, even though to you, you still seem like yourself. The spirit must have also replaced your abilities, so despite having thumbs and the dexterity to normally undo it, your skills are that of a small hound, unable to undo its own collar. So, while you see yourself as a nude, helpless boy being leashed and collared, the rest of the world sees you as nothing but a puppy being taken for a walk…</span> <br>
        <br>
        <span style="Color: LightSteelBlue">“<span style="color:DarkTurquoise">$LucasNickname</span>!?”</span> <span style="color:LightCoral">You turn to see <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Lucas</span>, staring at you in shock with a flushed face and shocked expression. He definitely doesn’t see you as a dog!</span> <br>
