<span style="color:LightCoral">You quickly gasp and try to rush back inside, but <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Gabe</span>’s grip on the collar sends you flying back.</span> <span style="Color: LightSteelBlue">“Come on, don’t be shy. He’s just our neighbor.”</span> <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Gabe</span> laughs, <span style="Color: LightSteelBlue">“Sorry, taking our dog for a walk. He’s a bit excitable today.”</span> <br>

