        <br>
        <span style="color:Pink">The feeling is amazing, though humiliating. It’s like going after holding all day on a long car drive, just the feeling of euphoric release as you finally let the gates burst open. Though you are just finishing up</span> <span style="color:LightCoral">when you look to your side and see a group of teenage girls watching you from across the street, bewildered and disgusted expressions on their faces as they quickly run off, the magic of the fox seemingly taking a bit longer to take affect there…</span> <br>
        <br>
        <span style="color:BlueViolet">The walk back is somehow even more humiliating than before, since you find yourself unable to stand up and have to crawl like a dog all the way back to your house, naked and with your penis, strangely, at full mast and unable to go down since you peed. You get the feeling this is the fox spirit trying to reward you, but it only adds to your humiliation.</span> <br>
        <br>
